        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "493117a4-0f1f-5497-8e9a-6162d5232023",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yoann Lemoine, Taylor Swift, Katy Perry, Lana Del Rey\n- Roles: music video director, graphic designer, singer-songwriter\n- Songs: \"Back to December\", \"Teenage Dream\", \"Born to Die\", \"Dreaming of Another World\"\n- Topics: music video direction, song themes, genre\n\nFacts:\n- Yoann Lemoine was born on 16 March 1983 and is a French music video director, graphic designer, and singer-songwriter.\n- Yoann Lemoine is notably known for directing music videos for Katy Perry's \"Teenage Dream,\" Taylor Swift's \"Back to December,\" Lana Del Rey's \"Born to Die,\" and Mystery Jets' \"Dreaming of Another World.\"\n- Taylor Swift said that \"Back to December\" was the first time she had ever apologized to someone in a song.\n- \"Back to December\" is considered an orchestral country pop ballad.\n- The lyrics of \"Back to December\" are a remorseful plea for forgiveness after breaking up with a former lover.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "4ca75741-39ee-5568-af29-0580948a2f62",
        "text": "Page: Yoann Lemoine. Sentence: Yoann Lemoine (born 16 March 1983) is a French music video director, graphic designer and singer-songwriter.\nPage: Yoann Lemoine. Sentence: His most notable works include his music video direction for Katy Perry's \"Teenage Dream\", Taylor Swift's single \"Back to December\", Lana Del Rey's \"Born to Die\" and Mystery Jets' \"Dreaming of Another World\".\nPage: Back to December. Sentence: According to Swift, \"Back to December\" is the first time she ever apologizes to someone in a song.\nPage: Back to December. Sentence: \"Back to December\" is considered an orchestral country pop ballad and its lyrics are a remorseful plea for forgiveness for breaking up with a former lover.",
